# This directory will contain usage examples for OCA.
# These can be simple scripts or markdown files demonstrating how to
# use the various commands and features of the tool.
#
# Examples could include:
# - `basic_refactoring.sh`: A shell script showing the refactor command.
# - `test_generation.py`: A Python script using OCA to generate its own tests.
# - `advanced_search.md`: A tutorial on using advanced search features.
#
# These examples are valuable for users and contributors to quickly
# understand how to use OCA effectively.
